   Asus offers an excellent ROG Strix RX 6600 XT OC Gaming which runs well with a more compact cooling design, two fans, while offering excellent performance as well as good temperatures.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>08/10/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RX6600XT-O8G-GAMING Media review Award of Gold Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://overclocking.com/test-rog-strix-rx-6600-xt-oc-gaming/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1302/202109231558125190205.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"7.8 rating\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Pokde\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>7.8 rating</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      AMD has just announced the Radeon RX 6600 XT late last month. As a 1080p-oriented card, AMD is targeting the card towards PC gamers who are looking for an upgrade from older cards. Since there are no reference models, AMD sent us what might be one of the best AIB designs for the Radeon RX 6600 XT, the ASUS ROG Strix Radeon RX 6600 XT OC Edition. Let’s see how will it perform.\n\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>MALAYSIA</span> <span>08/11/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RX6600XT-O8G-GAMING Media review Award of 7.8 rating\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://pokde.net/review/asus-rog-strix-radeon-rx-6600-xt-oc-edition-review\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1337/202011021621342620535.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Gold\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Profesional Review\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Gold</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      \nHigher than RTX 3060 in most games we've tested\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SPAIN</span> <span>08/10/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RX6600XT-O8G-GAMING Media review Award of Gold\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.profesionalreview.com/2021/08/10/amd-radeon-rx-6600-xt-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1349/202003041407165160842.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"編輯推薦\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      unikoshardware\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>編輯推薦</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      重新審視 ROG Strix Radeon RX 6600 XT OC 這張顯示卡，厚度達 2.6 槽 ，採用雙軸向式風扇配置，內部散熱結構使用 4 根熱管，燒機溫度只有 59 度，整體散熱還算不錯，而且外觀不但精巧也相當符合潮流，並搭配 ARGB 燈效，還有超頻不可缺的 ASUS GPU Tweak II 軟體，是一張值得列入你購買清單的顯示卡!\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>TAIWAN</span> <span>08/10/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RX6600XT-O8G-GAMING Media review Award of 編輯推薦\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://unikoshardware.com/2021/08/rog-strix-radeon-rx-6600-xt-review.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1272/202010291620243530143.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"e-zone Choice\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      e-zone\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>e-zone Choice</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Strong ability in heat-cooling, and is applicable to MiniPC systems\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>HONG KONG</span> <span>08/30/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RX6600XT-O8G-GAMING Media review Award of e-zone Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"http://Printed Magazine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1350/201911191849478810279.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Best Performance\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      www.vmodtech.com\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Best Performance</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      A mid-range graphics card suited for full HD gaming, the GPU has been hardware optimized and upgraded to offer a host of core features including ray tracing, compute, and rasterized effects to deliver high-level effects as close as possible to realism.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>THAILAND</span> <span>08/10/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RX6600XT-O8G-GAMING Media review Award of Best Performance\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"http://www.vmodtech.com/th/article/asus-rog-strix-rx6600xt-o8g-gaming-review\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1352/202102181722056070343.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Advanced Performance\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Pchocasi.com.tr\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Advanced Performance</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ROG Strix RX 6600 XT cycles between 115W and 135W in games at Full HD and Ultra settings. Temperatures go up to 58 degrees. I have to say these are very successful results.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>Türkiye</span> <span>08/16/2021</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG-STRIX-RX6600XT-O8G-GAMING Media review Award of Advanced Performance\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://youtu.be/58YylrZfY00\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__